WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Kopanya mobu o ka hodimo o tswang dibakeng tse mmalwa tsa bethe. Tlosa majwe, metso le makgasi.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Tlatsa karolo ya boraro ya nkgo ka mobu. Eketsa metsi le sesepa sa dijana. E kwale, o e sisinye, o e behe fatshe.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Kamora motsotso o le mong, lehlabathe le dutse ka tlase. Tshwaya bokahodimo ba mokgahlelo oo.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Kamora dihora tse pedi, tshwaya bokahodimo ba mokgahlelo o latelang. Ke seretse se setle (silt).

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Hlahloba kamora letsatsi le le leng kapa a mabedi. Ha metsi a batla a hlakile, tshwaya mokgahlelo wa letsopa. Se phaphametseng ke organic matter.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Bapisa bophahamo ba mokgahlelo ka mong le bophahamo bohle ba mobu o dutseng ka nkgong.
